# Hero video renditions. The four the homepage actually uses are committed and served from
# Vercel's CDN -- see app/public/videos/README.md for why that beats the alternatives on this
# plan. Everything else here is source material that nothing references, and stays out.
app/public/videos/*.mp4
!app/public/videos/hero-triptych.mp4
!app/public/videos/hero-1-mobile.mp4
!app/public/videos/hero-2-mobile.mp4
!app/public/videos/hero-3-mobile.mp4
